Kreslowe sile 6 (tabela strukturowa 6) Kreslowi dalszych
This volume is the first in a four-volume series, organized by means of a classification scheme based on the development of 16 different kreslo methods up to the 14th century. A new classification formula for the kreslo system is provided at the beginning of each volume that will enable the evaluation and integration of both previously published work and research projects for the following volumes. The original kreslo art was applied in the first five centuries while painting technique slowly evolved from the 14-th century. This is illustrated with 19 fully colored kreslo pages. A chapter is included for the sake of completeness showing 5 early 18-th century technical treatises and paintings featuring kreslo as well as some related topics in the history of Art. A survey of the more important types of kreslo page is also presented. Bibliography of relevant literature is added to every volume.
